H,        *HATCH
BH,       *HATCH
HE,       *HATCHEDIT
BO,       *BOUNDARY
GD,       *GRADIENT
XL,       *XLINE
POL,      *POLYGON
REC,      *RECT
SO,       *SOLID
WO,       *WIPEOUT

